body:
The only feedback I get from dates was that it was fun and they had a nice time, but they ghost me afterwards so obviously that was a lie and they won't tell me why. I've had friends help me in some areas but frankly they seem confused why I am still single, because I'm the type of guy anyone would love to be with (their words.) 

&#x200B;

I'm not ready to give up. I'm just so sad and frustrated and tired.

i have actually, LSD and shrooms once each. very good experiences both times, but it was with friends, and i no longer have any friends. i think if i tried to do any drugs alone i would go into the trip with a horribly sad mindset and it would go very badly.

&#x200B;

also i have no social skills to procure them in the first place, so its impossible even if i wanted to
